      Aptura mark: a cyan aperture disc whose triangular opening is the play symbol, with three curved
      iris seams. The seams are cut as rounded strokes over the disc, so the mark keeps a clean circular
      silhouette at launcher sizes. Geometry is shared with docs/assets/logo.png.
    -->
